2 CONT He inherited the estates of Hackeweide from Berendt Johann von Schulmann (1660-1746.  Sold this estate to August Karl von Berg for 50,00 silver rubles.
2 CONT
2 CONT He also had the estate Jelgimaeggi which he inherited from his father and sold in 1762 for 13,000 silver rubles to Detlev von Derfelden
2 CONT
2 CONT November 27th 1749 he was made an Officer Candidate and the Lieutenant in 1750.  IN 1750 he was also a manngerichtsadjunkt.
2 CONT
