1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Johan Appelbom=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Anders Samuelsson Appelbom and Anna Dorotea Löfling
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Appelbom_nr_325#TAB_15 Johan Appelbom]''' (son av Anders Appelbom, tab 12). Född 1688. Brukspatron på Österhammar. Gift med Elisabet Falck, dotter av ryttmästaren vid Smalands kavallerirege
2 CONC mente Peter Falck och Maria Gahm.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''TAB 15'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan Anders Appelbom (son of Anders Appelbom, tab 12 ). Born 1688. Factory owner in Österhammar. Married to Elisabet Falck , daughter of the cavalry commander of the Smaland cavalry regiment Peter Falck and Maria Gahm .
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=  
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Johan Fredrik,''' baptized 1714-02-21 at Österhammar. Cornet. Died 1742.
2 CONT * '''Maija Appelbom,''' 
2 CONT * '''Maria Sofia.''' Married 1736-10-10 in Björskog parish to the cavalry master Bengt Gustaf Ahlbom in his 2nd marriage.
2 CONT * '''Anna Margareta,''' born 1718-11-10 in Österhammar. Married 1739-02-04 in Björskog parish to lieutenant corporal Gustaf Herveghr .
2 CONT * '''Carl Gustaf''', born 1721. Lieutenant. Died 1794. 
2 CONT * '''Petronella Elisabet,''' born 1724-08-27 in Österhammar. Died 1768-01-20 in Köping. Married in 1751 to the rope maker in Köping Johan Christian Svalberg in his 1st marriage.
