2 CONT 1790 :	Marriage (with Lovisa Brandel) - Alger
2 CONT Sources: Rehbinder genom 800 år (emejl Finn Jelstrup)
2 CONT July 10, 1810 :	Death
2 CONT Sources: Rehbinder genom 800 år (emejl Finn Jelstrup)
