2 CONT Count [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Friedrich_Wilhelm_von_Buxhoeveden Friedrich Wilhelm von Buxhoevden] (other spellings: Feodor Buxhoeveden, Buxhœwden, Buxhöwden) (September 14, 1750 Võlla, Governorate of Livonia – August 23, 18
2 CONC 11 near Kullamaa) was a Russian infantry general and government official. Buxhoeveden commanded the Russian armies during the Finnish War.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT http://www.blf.fi/artikel.php?id=617
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
