1 NAME Fabian Johann /von Schulman/
2 GIVN Fabian Johann
2 SURN von Schulman
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 11 OCT 1755
1 DEAT
2 DATE 18 AUG 1809
2 PLAC Dorpat
2 ADDR
1 OCCU Assessor, Arvherre till Tammik, Sall, Moisama och Koil
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He inherited the estates of Tammik, Sall, Moisama and Koil.  He also owned the estates of Repshof and Serrafer
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a spendthrift and had to sell Tammik on July 2nd 1802 to Gotthard von Knorring for 50,000 silver rubles and 5,000 banco rubles.   This included 173 serfs.
2 CONT
2 CONT He leased Koil and Sall on March 6th 1794 for 40 years to his brother Peter Alexander for 65,000 silver rubles.   They then agreed to sell Koil on March 8th 1794 to Karl von Friederici for 20,000 silver rubles and 20,000 banco rub
2 CONC les.
2 CONT
2 CONT He sold the estate Moisama on June 21st 1797 to his brother Detlev August for 30,000 silver rubles. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He pledged the estate Repshof in 1794 to A.A. von Rosenkampff for a loan of 30,000 silver rubles and 6,000 banco rubles.  
2 CONT
2 CONT He pledged the estate of Serrafer in March 5th 1802 to Georg Johann von Wrangel 
2 CONT
