1 NAME Peter Reinhold /Appelman/ d.y., till Hohenwardt
2 GIVN Peter Reinhold
2 NSFX d.y., till Hohenwardt
2 _MARNM Appelman
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 2 OCT 1743
2 ADDR
3 CITY Turku
